  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ひかりに　かざすと　かがやく　ぬの。\nむかし　にんげんが　ほうじょうのおうに\nかんしゃの　きもちとして　ささげていた。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "빛에 비추면 반짝이는 천.\n과거에 인간들이 풍요의 왕에게\n감사하는 마음을 담아 바쳤다고 한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "透光時會熠熠生輝的布料。\n人們曾經將它獻給豐饒之王，\n藉此表達感謝之意。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une courroie faite d’un tissu qui scintille à la lumière.\nLes humains en offraient autrefois au Seigneur\ndes récoltes en gage de leur gratitude.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Zügel gewoben aus Stoff, der leuchtet, wenn man ihn\nins Licht hält. Einst schenkten die Menschen sie dem\nKönig der reichen Ernte als Zeichen ihrer Dankbarkeit.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Correas elaboradas con un tejido que brilla bajo la luz.\nEn el pasado, los humanos las entregaban como ofrenda\nal Rey de las Cosechas en señal de gratitud.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Nastri che risplendono se illuminati. Un tempo venivano\nofferti dagli esseri umani al Re dell’abbondanza in\nsegno di gratitudine.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cords that shine when you hold them up to the light.\nThe people of old times presented these to the King of\nBountiful Harvests to express their gratitude.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "光に　かざすと　かがやく　布。\n昔　人間が　豊穣の王に\n感謝の　気持ちとして　捧げていた。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "拿到光下即可生辉的布。\n人们曾经将其进献给\n丰饶之王以表感谢之意。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Correas elaboradas con un tejido que brilla bajo la luz.\nEn el pasado, los humanos las entregaban como ofrenda\nal Rey de las Cosechas en señal de gratitud.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
